 "words": 211,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "An old man in Haran with his flocks and with his kin",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Heard a voice that called him out to where he'd never been",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Leave your land, your kindred, and your father's house",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And go to the land I will show you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Abram went, as the LORD had told him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Sarai by his side and the long road in his eyes",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The years went by in Canaan and the cradle still stood bare",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord GOD, what will you give me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I remain childless",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He brought him outside",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And told the childless man to lift his weary eyes",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look up at the sky and count the stars",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can count them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So shall your offspring be",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abram believed the LORD",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he credited it to him as righteousness",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Up the mountain walked a father with the son he loved",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here are the fire and the wood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But where is the lamb",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God himself will provide the lamb",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the two of them walked on together",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look up at the sky and count the stars",
